 <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no"><meta name="theme-color" content="#111016">
 <title>NEON RONIN — Arena das Cinzas</title>
 <style>
